Usage: millstream run [<dirs> ...] [flags]
       millstream run <command> [<args>] [flags]

Run packages locally with an embedded engine, or print a run's report.

Default command:
  run [<dirs> ...]          Apply packages and run the engine with an embedded node.
                            Its arguments and flags: "millstream run packages --help"

Commands:
  report <pipeline> <run>   Print a run's report: critical path, slowest steps, failures, cost,
                            comparison.

Run "millstream run <command> --help" for a command's arguments and flags.
